# Opinionated "golden stack" for polyglot services: one JSON object per line on stdout.
# Schema: timestamp, level, service, trace_id, span_id, message (OpenTelemetry trace correlation).
# Transport: stdout -> Fluent Bit -> Elasticsearch or Loki; traces: OTel + Jaeger (see project docs).
# Ref: https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/logs/
